## ❓ Likely Questions + Answers

**Q: Real backend kyun nahi?**
> A: Internship scope mein mock auth + AsyncStorage use kiya. Production mein API + JWT add hoga.

**Q: State management library kyun nahi (Redux/Zustand)?**
> A: Context API kaafi hai is scale pe. Redux overkill hota. Modular contexts (5) se clean code hai.

**Q: API fail ho toh?**
> A: Timeout 10 seconds hai. Error state dikhega with Retry button.

**Q: Accessibility?**
> A: Touch targets 44px+ hain. Contrast ratios WCAG AA meet karte hain.

**Q: Performance?**
> A: FlatList optimized — initialNumToRender, windowSize, removeClippedSubviews, React.memo.

**Q: Tests likhe?**
> A: Manual testing ki. Unit tests scope ke bahar the — production mein Jest + RNTL add hoga.

